# Reins of the Winterspring Frostsaber from Rivern Frostwind, for Exalted
# Wintersaber Trainers (Era rule; the reputation is server-side).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level
# 60, 200g, no riding rank asked); items.json / npcs.json for the vendors.

step Wintersaber Trainers
  tip Rivern Frostwind at Frostsaber Rock in northern Winterspring offers the repeatable Frostsaber Provisions, Winterfall Intrusion and Rampaging Giants (level 58); they are the whole road to Exalted, so expect weeks of turn-ins.
  rep "Wintersaber Trainers" Exalted
  talk 10618                          -- Rivern Frostwind, Frostsaber Rock

step Reins of the Winterspring Frostsaber
  tip The Forever client lists it at 200g and level 60, and asks for no riding rank.
  level 60
  buy 13086 npc 10618                 -- Rivern Frostwind, 200g
